// note: SUMMARIZE over Sales by order: each group's rows filter StoreProfile through Store (as tpcds fuzz3-0139's catalog groups reach store sales through shared dimensions); order 9008's lines have no store (Store's blank row), so does its group see StoreProfile's row of a key Store lacks (BER-01, 2 floors)?
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZE(
    CALCULATETABLE(Sales, Sales[Order Number] IN { 1, 2, 9008, 9009 }),
    Sales[Order Number],
    "Floors", SUM(StoreProfile[Floors]),
    "Profiles", COUNTROWS(StoreProfile)
)
ORDER BY Sales[Order Number]
